# skills: Rufus's Rally (one ally's ATK up one stage) through the game's ally picker, and its refusal.
# Jian and Rufus (party_rufus), Rufus at level 1 (level index 0 pinned, battle MP pinned to 50), first
# temple battle. Round 1: Jian Fights; Rufus's Special list holds Thunder Sword, Rally, and Stand Fast
# (shot ra_list after Down, on Rally); A opens the ally picker (ra_picker) and A casts on Jian: the ATK UP
# banner on Jian (ra_a to ra_l), MP 50 -> 44, Jian's ATK stage 0 -> 1 and his ATK up by a quarter; Rufus's
# own stage stays 0. Round 2: the same pick is refused, "No effect!" on the name bar and the picker
# stays (ra_refused), no MP taken; Right moves to Rufus himself and A casts on him (his stage 0 -> 1,
# MP 50 -> 44 again).
# Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: status in the low nibble of +0x08, HP +0x14, MP +0x18, ATK DEF AGI INT +0x24 +0x28 +0x30 +0x34, their stages +0x40 +0x42 +0x44 +0x46). Run with --save.
include party_rufus
pin u32 0x020B47D4 0
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x84 50
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228e8e4 rufus_mp
watch u16 0x0228e8a0 jian_atk_stage
watch u32 0x0228e884 jian_atk
watch u16 0x0228e8a2 jian_def_stage
watch u32 0x0228e888 jian_def
watch u16 0x0228e8a4 jian_agi_stage
watch u32 0x0228e890 jian_agi
watch u16 0x0228e8a6 jian_int_stage
watch u32 0x0228e894 jian_int
watch u16 0x0228e90c rufus_atk_stage
watch u32 0x0228e8f0 rufus_atk
watch u16 0x0228e90e rufus_def_stage
watch u32 0x0228e8f4 rufus_def
watch u16 0x0228e910 rufus_agi_stage
watch u32 0x0228e8fc rufus_agi
watch u16 0x0228e912 rufus_int_stage
watch u32 0x0228e900 rufus_int
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 50
shot ra_list
press A 8
wait 60
shot ra_picker
press A 8
wait 30
wait 0
